  "styleIsolationGuidance": "Use pinned native upstream React packages and their compiled CSS, with MantineProvider and its default theme scoped in an iframe or a portal-aware dedicated host. Studio Geist/green/12px styling must not leak into reference baselines. Every template needs an exact official demo ID, fixtures, size/variant and scheme; a library name alone is not a single visual design.",
