  "dedupNotes": [
    "Mantine Dialog is a non-modal fixed surface; do not merge with Modal/AlertDialog solely because names sound similar.",
    "Collapse is the animation container; Accordion owns trigger/disclosure semantics. Collapsible+Collapse may share a visual category but are not API-identical.",
